          <h2 class="font-heading">Stack</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="https://www.11ty.dev/">Eleventy (11ty)</a> (static site builder)</li>
            <li><a href="https://nunjucks.io/">Nunjucks</a> (templating)</li>
            <li><a href="https://www.markdownguide.org/">Markdown</a> (content)</li>
            <li><a href="https://alpinejs.dev/">Alpine.js</a> (JavaScript)</li>
            <li><a href="https://splidejs.com/">Splide.js</a> (carousels)</li>
            <li><a href="https://fontawesome.com/">Font Awesome</a> (icons)</li>
            <li><a href="https://github.com/">GitHub</a> (code hosting)</li>
            <li><a href="https://pages.github.com/">GitHub Pages</a> (deployment)</li>
            <li><a href="https://figma.com/">Figma</a> (graphic design)</li>
            <li><a href="https://figma.com/">Figma Motion</a> (animation)</li>
            <li><a href="https://www.rdkit.org/">RDKit</a> (3D molecule rendering)</li>
          </ul>
