      <div class="card mb-4">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="font-heading">Inspiration</h2>
          Cred where credit's due. I believe in sharing your sources. The design for this site was inspired by many great creators who you should check out
          <ul>
            <li>The stick figure design is based on Randall Munroe's ever-genius<a href="https://www.xkcd.com/">XKCD</a> and the associated font is literally Randall's own handwriting.</li>
            <li>Rob Cantor: Rob's site used to load with a seemingly static photo of him staring into your soul, except after a few seconds you realilse it was a video as he starts to eat a random fruit, every time it loads the site serves up a different random video of him eating something different.</li>
            <li>Zen Browser: The cream and charcoal styling and Bricolage Grotesque font was basically stolen from Zen's marketing</li>
            <li>My good friend and incredible UX designer, Dev Patel, has a wonderful portfolio, I stole the design of several of his components</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      
